  "nameJa": "ダンベル n=1",
  "descriptionEn": "Two unit disks centred at (±1.3, 0) connected by a rectangular channel of half-width n. As n → 0 the first two Dirichlet eigenvalues become asymptotically degenerate (Jimbo 1989; Arrieta 1995).",
